# Spider-Punk: "Spells and abilities can't be countered" (CR 101.2, 701.6a) - every spell and ability, whoever controls it.
# Bot1 controls Spider-Punk; on turn 2 Bot1's own Counterspell leaves Bot2's Thraben Inspector on the stack and it resolves,
# and Bot1's Stifle leaves the Inspector's trigger, so Bot2 investigates. "Other Spiders you control have riot" is Bot1's own: Bot2's
# Canopy Spider enters on turn 4 with no riot, and no choice is asked (one asked would take the runner's default, a counter).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Spider-Punk
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Counterspell
Stifle
Mountain x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Thraben Inspector
Forest
Canopy Spider
Plains x16

